        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Rani Jhansi Marine National Park, Jhansi district, Uttar Pradesh, India, North India\n- People: Lakshmibai, the Rani of Jhansi\n- Roles: Queen of Jhansi\n- Topics: Commemoration\n\nFacts:\n- Lakshmibai, the Rani of Jhansi, was born on 19 November 1828.\n- Lakshmibai was the queen of the princely state of Jhansi in North India, in the area now in Jhansi district, Uttar Pradesh, India.\n- Lakshmibai, the Rani of Jhansi, died on 18 June 1858.\n- Rani Jhansi Marine National Park commemorates Lakshmibai, the Rani of Jhansi.",
